<title>NORWAY: DnB, CBK up on Oslo bourse.</title>
<headline>DnB, CBK up on Oslo bourse.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Den norske Bank (DnB) and Christiania Bank og Kreditkasse rose in brisk trade on the Oslo Stock Exchange after announcing first-quarter results on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Christiania was up 0.80 crowns at 24.30 crowns in turnover of 29 million crowns nearly an hour into the session. DnB stood at 26.20 crowns, up 0.70 crowns, in turnover of 13 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
